    "Complications now call liver/cirrhosis_decompensation for correlated assessment, non-ICU recovery, and severity-based escalation to ICU/transplant care.",
    "Cause remains unspecified unless explicitly supplied as liver_cirrhosis_etiology=alcohol. No alcohol-use disorder is inferred.",
    "Native-liver management resumes after medical recovery and stops after transplantation. Regional referral selection is upstream; the existing hospital cohort is not filtered a second time."
